WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.010
Mind my foot! You're standing on my footpad.

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.150
I'm Eagle's descent stage.

3
00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:11.200
On the 20th of July, 1969, I burned for 756 seconds

4
00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.400
to land two humans at Tranquility Base.

5
00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:20.510
Engineers gave me four legs, a ladder, and room to carry science. And no seats.

6
00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:23.600
Talk about standing room only.

7
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.560
After 21 hours, Eagle's top half launched from my back.

8
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.070
I stayed behind.

9
00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:31.100
17 meters away, my little sibling, EASEP,

10
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.110
listened for tremors in the Moon.

11
00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:36.670
It measured dust, powered by the sun.

12
00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:40.230
It even survived heat 30 degrees past plan.

13
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.390
Then, on the 27th of August, it stopped answering.

14
00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:49.860
Five meters away, a reflector needs no power at all.

15
00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:52.480
Keep waiting. Come say hi.

